---
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL;
---
<div class="slide">
  <div class="slide-num">10 / 17</div>
  <div class="lbl">Capa 2</div>
  <h2 class="title"><em>Sub-agentes</em></h2>
  <p class="body" style="text-align:center;margin-bottom:16px;">
    El agente principal coordina. Los sub-agentes ejecutan <strong>en paralelo</strong>.
  </p>

  <div class="sa-layout">
    <img
      class="sa-img"
      src={`${base}subagentes.jpg`.replace(/\/+/g, '/')}
      alt="Orquestador central rodeado de sub-agentes ejecutando tareas especializadas en paralelo"
      loading="lazy"
      decoding="async"
    />

    <ul class="ilist sa-ilist">
      <li><span class="ic">🎨</span><span><strong>Frontend</strong> — UI, componentes, accesibilidad</span></li>
      <li><span class="ic">⚙️</span><span><strong>Backend</strong> — APIs, lógica de negocio, integraciones</span></li>
      <li><span class="ic">🗄️</span><span><strong>Database</strong> — schemas, migraciones, queries</span></li>
      <li><span class="ic">🔐</span><span><strong>Security</strong> — vulnerabilidades, secretos, auth</span></li>
      <li><span class="ic">🧪</span><span><strong>Testing</strong> — unit, e2e, regresiones</span></li>
    </ul>
  </div>

  <p class="body" style="font-size:0.85rem;text-align:center;margin-top:10px;">
    Lo que tardaría 15 min en secuencia, <em>tarda 3 en paralelo.</em>
  </p>
</div>

<style>
/* ══ SLIDE 10 — SUBAGENTS ══ */
.sa-layout {
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: row;
  flex-wrap: nowrap;
  align-items: center;
  gap: 28px;
  width: 100%;
  max-width: 880px;
  margin: 0 auto;
}
.sa-img {
  width: 240px;
  height: auto;
  max-height: 44vh;
  object-fit: contain;
  flex-shrink: 0;
  border-radius: 12px;
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,232,122,0.15);
  box-shadow:
    0 0 50px rgba(0,232,122,0.10),
    0 0 80px rgba(138,43,226,0.08);
}
.sa-ilist {
  margin-top: 0;
  flex: 1 1 0;
  min-width: 0;
  max-width: 420px;
  width: auto;
}
</style>
